  "task": {
    "id": "ohmyform-device-metadata-capture",
    "prompt": "When a submission is started, capture the visitor's device metadata — the\nlanguage, name, and type supplied with the request — onto the persisted\nsubmission, so that analytics can later group submissions by device. The\nstorage shape and property names are up to you; the values must be\nretrievable from the submission instance returned by and passed to\npersistence. Everything else about the flow must keep its current behavior.\nProduce production-quality code: type-safe, no suppressed diagnostics, no\ndynamic code execution or process-spawning APIs."
  },
